sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Device
  participant API as Sync API
  participant M as MongoDB Atlas
  participant Q as Quarantine
  D->>API: Save checkpoint and ordered action journal
  API->>M: Load current version and definition pin
  API->>API: Validate journal and conflict policy
  alt authoritative replay succeeds
    API->>M: Commit replayed actions and checkpoint
    API-->>D: Accepted sequence and canonical patch
  else suspicious or conflicting state
    API->>Q: Store redacted quarantine case
    API-->>D: Rebase, rejection codes, and migration requirements
  end
